<main class="sovo-completion" aria-labelledby="sovo-copy-sent-title">
  <section class="sovo-completion__panel">
    <div class="sovo-completion__brand"><%= render 'start_form/banner' %></div>
    <div class="sovo-completion__body">
      <div class="sovo-completion__mark" aria-hidden="true">✓</div>
      <p class="sovo-completion__eyebrow">SOVO DOCUMENT DELIVERY</p>
      <h1 id="sovo-copy-sent-title">签署副本已发送</h1>
      <p class="sovo-completion__intro">请查看您的邮箱，并下载邮件中的签署文件副本。建议保存最终 PDF，方便日后查阅。<br><span style="font-size:.92em;">Check your inbox and download the signed document copy. Keep the final PDF for your records.</span></p>
      <p class="sovo-completion__receipt">如果暂时没有收到，请检查垃圾邮件文件夹，或联系您的 SOVO 顾问。<br>If it does not arrive, check your spam folder or contact your SOVO advisor.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>
